5,0,1,talk,Daisuke,,"Um... hello everyone. I'm not really sure what to say first, but I hope we can all work together to find the werewolf. Please be kind to me.","{""words"":28,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,0,1,talk,Victoria,,"It is a pleasure to meet you all. Let us remain calm and observant. Since we have no information yet, I suggest we pay close attention to how everyone speaks and reacts today.","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,0,1,talk,Shunichi,,"Well said, Victoria. Though ""observing"" is just a fancy way of saying we're all guessing for now. Let's see who cracks first under the pressure. I'm sure this will be quite entertaining.","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,0,1,talk,Takumi,,"Entertaining? This isn't a game to you, is it, Shunichi? We're trying to find a monster! I don't care who ""cracks,"" I just want to make sure we protect each other and get this over with.","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,0,1,talk,Ryuji,,"Let's keep our emotions in check. Takumi, aggression won't help us find the werewolf. For now, we should simply listen and analyze the patterns of our conversation. I will be observing everyone's logic.","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,0,2,talk,Daisuke,,"I... I agree with Ryuji. We should stay calm. @Shunichi, please don't make fun of us... it makes me nervous. I'll do my best to help, even if I'm not very good at this.","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[""Ryuji"",""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,0,2,talk,Victoria,,"@Daisuke, there is no need to be nervous. We are all in this together. @Shunichi, your attitude is indeed a bit provocative, but let us focus on the facts. Does anyone have a specific strategy for the first few days?","{""words"":40,""mentions"":[""Daisuke"",""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,0,2,talk,Shunichi,,"Strategy? Please, Victoria. The only strategy on Day 0 is to see who's trying too hard to look innocent. @Daisuke, your nervousness is almost too perfect. It's almost cute, really.","{""words"":30,""mentions"":[""Victoria"",""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,0,2,talk,Takumi,,"@Shunichi, stop picking on Daisuke! Just because he's quiet doesn't mean he's lying. You're the one acting weird by treating this like a joke. Why are you so obsessed with who looks ""innocent""?","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[""Shunichi"",""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,0,2,talk,Ryuji,,"@Takumi, your protectiveness is noted, but let's not let it cloud our judgment. @Shunichi, while your approach is abrasive, your point about overacting is a valid observation in these games. Let's continue observing.","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[""Takumi"",""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,0,3,talk,Daisuke,,"I... I'm not overacting. I'm just... really scared. @Ryuji, thank you for understanding. I'll try to be more helpful, but please, let's just try to be nice to each other.","{""words"":30,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,0,3,talk,Victoria,,"@Daisuke, your feelings are valid, but try to stay focused. @Ryuji, you seem very detached. While logic is essential, I wonder if your insistence on ""patterns"" is a way to distance yourself from the group.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[""Daisuke"",""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,0,3,talk,Shunichi,,"@Victoria, you're analyzing Ryuji now? How fascinating. We've gone from observing patterns to psychoanalyzing each other in three turns. At this rate, we'll find the werewolf by sheer coincidence. I'm just enjoying the show.","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[""Victoria"",""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,0,3,talk,Takumi,,"@Shunichi, you're just talking in circles to avoid saying anything useful! If you're so smart, why aren't you actually helping us? I'm tired of your ""show."" We need to be serious if we want to survive!","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,0,3,talk,Ryuji,,"@Takumi, shouting doesn't produce results. @Victoria, my detachment is simply a method to remain objective. Since we have no data yet, the most rational move is to avoid premature accusations and continue listening.","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[""Takumi"",""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,0,4,talk,Daisuke,,"I... I think Ryuji is right. We don't have any clues yet, so we shouldn't fight. I'll try my best to think carefully tonight... I hope we can all survive tomorrow.","{""words"":31,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over.""}]}"
21,0,4,pass,Daisuke,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
22,0,4,talk,Victoria,,"I agree with Daisuke. Since we have no concrete evidence, fighting only creates noise. I will spend my time tonight reflecting on these interactions. Let us see what tomorrow brings.","{""words"":30,""mentions"":[""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over.""}]}"
23,0,4,pass,Victoria,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
24,0,4,talk,Shunichi,,"It seems we've reached a consensus of cautious silence. How boring. I'll be watching all of you very closely tomorrow to see whose ""reflection"" leads to a slip-up. Goodnight, everyone.","{""words"":30,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over.""}]}"
25,0,4,pass,Shunichi,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
26,0,4,talk,Takumi,,"I'm not going to let you just ""watch"" us like we're some kind of experiment, Shunichi! I'll be watching you too. We'll find the werewolf and get out of here. Goodnight.","{""words"":31,""mentions"":[""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over""}]}"
27,0,4,pass,Takumi,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
28,0,4,talk,Ryuji,,"It is clear that emotions are running high, particularly between Takumi and Shunichi. I will continue to analyze these dynamics. Let us see what the first night reveals. Goodnight.","{""words"":29,""mentions"":[""Takumi"",""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over""}]}"
