36,1,1,talk,Daisuke,,"Um... good morning. I... I have something to tell you all. I'm the Seer, and I divined Ryuji last night. He... he is the werewolf. Please, we have to believe me.","{""words"":31,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,1,1,talk,Victoria,,"@Daisuke, thank you for coming forward so quickly. If your divination is accurate, we have a clear target. @Ryuji, how do you respond to this direct accusation? Your reaction now will be very telling.","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[""Daisuke"",""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,1,1,talk,Shunichi,,"@Daisuke, coming out as the Seer on day one? How bold. Either you're incredibly brave, or you're a very desperate werewolf trying to frame Ryuji before he can even speak. This is getting interesting.","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[""Daisuke"",""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,1,1,talk,Takumi,,"@Daisuke, you're the Seer? I knew you were a good guy! @Ryuji, you've got some explaining to do. You were acting all ""logical"" and ""detached"" just to hide the fact that you're the monster, right? We've got you now!","{""words"":39,""mentions"":[""Daisuke"",""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,1,1,talk,Ryuji,,"@Daisuke, claiming the Seer role so early is a high-risk move. It is far more likely that you are the werewolf attempting to secure an early execution by framing me. My logic remains unchanged: this is a desperate play.","{""words"":39,""mentions"":[""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,1,2,talk,Daisuke,,"I... I'm not lying! I was so scared, but I knew I had to tell you the truth right away so we could stop the werewolf. @Ryuji, please... why are you trying to make me look like the liar?","{""words"":39,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,1,2,talk,Victoria,,"@Ryuji, your defense is purely theoretical. You are calling Daisuke's move ""high-risk,"" but if Daisuke were the werewolf, would he really expose himself as the Seer so early? That would make him a primary target once the real Seer speaks.","{""words"":40,""mentions"":[""Ryuji"",""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,1,2,talk,Shunichi,,"@Victoria, you're far too trusting. A werewolf who claims Seer early can control the narrative and force a vote before anyone can think. It's a classic gamble. @Daisuke, your trembling is quite convincing, but is it fear or guilt?","{""words"":39,""mentions"":[""Victoria"",""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,1,2,talk,Takumi,,"@Shunichi, shut up! You're just trying to confuse everyone so the werewolf can hide! @Daisuke is terrified but he's telling us the truth. @Ryuji, you're just using big words to trick us. We're voting for you!","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[""Shunichi"",""Daisuke"",""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,1,2,talk,Ryuji,,"@Takumi, your emotional response is predictable, but it doesn't prove my guilt. @Victoria, a werewolf claiming Seer is a common tactic to eliminate a threat quickly. If you vote for me based on a claim, you risk losing a human.","{""words"":40,""mentions"":[""Takumi"",""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,1,3,talk,Daisuke,,"I... I'm not gambling! I just wanted to save everyone. @Ryuji, you're just trying to confuse us with logic because you're caught. Please, everyone, believe me... I really saw it in my vision!","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,1,3,talk,Victoria,,"@Ryuji, you continue to argue from a general perspective rather than addressing the specific claim. If you are human, you are simply a victim of a lie, but your detachment feels more like a shield than a defense. I am inclined to trust Daisuke.","{""words"":44,""mentions"":[""Ryuji"",""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,1,3,talk,Shunichi,,"@Victoria, your ""inclination"" is dangerously sentimental. If we execute Ryuji and he's human, we've just done the werewolf's job for them. @Daisuke, if you're the Seer, who else would you divine tonight? Give us a plan, not just tears.","{""words"":39,""mentions"":[""Victoria"",""Ryuji"",""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,1,3,talk,Takumi,,"@Shunichi, stop trying to act like the boss! Daisuke already gave us the answer we need. Why are you working so hard to protect Ryuji? It's starting to look like you're the one helping the werewolf!","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[""Shunichi"",""Daisuke"",""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,1,3,talk,Ryuji,,"@Takumi, your accusation is based on emotion, not evidence. @Shunichi is simply questioning the validity of a claim. If we execute me based on a lie, the werewolf wins. We must consider the possibility that Daisuke is the wolf.","{""words"":39,""mentions"":[""Takumi"",""Shunichi"",""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
51,1,4,talk,Daisuke,,"I... I'll divine Shunichi tonight! If I survive, I'll tell you if he's human or not. Please, everyone... Ryuji is the werewolf. I know it. I can't let him kill any more of us. Please vote for Ryuji!","{""words"":38,""mentions"":[""Shunichi"",""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
52,1,4,talk,Victoria,,"@Daisuke, your willingness to name your next target shows commitment to the truth. @Ryuji, your defense is too clinical. I believe Daisuke. I will vote for Ryuji to ensure our safety.","{""words"":31,""mentions"":[""Daisuke"",""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
53,1,4,talk,Shunichi,,"@Daisuke, targeting me next? How predictable. You're trying to build a wall of trust around yourself by offering a ""future"" result. It's a clever play, but it doesn't erase the risk. I'll vote based on who's most suspicious.","{""words"":38,""mentions"":[""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
54,1,4,talk,Takumi,,"@Shunichi, you're just trying to stall! You're clearly protecting Ryuji because you're in on it. I don't care about your ""risks""—I trust Daisuke! Ryuji, you're done. I'm voting for you!","{""words"":30,""mentions"":[""Shunichi"",""Ryuji"",""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
55,1,4,talk,Ryuji,,"@Takumi, your blind trust is a liability. @Victoria, you are choosing emotion over caution. If you execute me, you are trusting a claim without proof. I am human; the real threat is the one manipulating you. I vote for Daisuke.","{""words"":40,""mentions"":[""Takumi"",""Victoria"",""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
